{
  "name": "PaneLayout",
  "group": "layout",
  "description": "Mosaico de paneles redimensionables: árbol de divisiones, cabecera y menú por panel, y arrastre de un panel al borde de otro.",
  "import": "import { PaneLayout } from \"@zuccadev-labs/zuix-zout\"",
  "behavior": "dom",
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "layout",
      "type": "PaneNode",
      "required": true,
      "description": "Árbol controlado: { type: \"pane\", id } o { type: \"split\", direction: \"row\" | \"column\", sizes, children }."
    },
    {
      "name": "onLayoutChange",
      "type": "(layout: PaneNode) => void",
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "name": "panes",
      "type": "Record<string, PaneInfo>",
      "required": true,
      "description": "Por id: { title, icon?, subtitle?, actions?, content, closable? }."
    },
    {
      "name": "onSplit",
      "type": "(id, direction) => string | undefined",
      "description": "Devuelve el id del panel nuevo; sin él, el menú no ofrece dividir."
    },
    {
      "name": "onClose",
      "type": "(id: string) => void",
      "description": "Tras cerrar un panel desde su menú."
    },
    {
      "name": "focusedId",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Panel con el foco (controlado). También onFocusedChange."
    },
    {
      "name": "labels",
      "type": "Partial<PaneLayoutLabels>",
      "description": "menu(title), splitRight, splitDown, moveLeft, moveRight, moveUp, moveDown, close, divider, moved(title). En inglés por defecto."
    }
  ],
  "states": ["rest", "focused", "dragging", "drop"],
  "tokens": ["accent", "accent-soft", "radius-lg", "layer-raised", "space-1"],
  "classes": [
    "z-panelayout",
    "z-panelayout__pane",
    "z-panelayout__grab",
    "z-panelayout__drop",
    "z-panelayout__menu",
    "z-panelayout__status"
  ],
  "a11y": "Cada panel es una `section` nombrada por su título (aria-labelledby). Los divisores son el patrón «window splitter» de SplitPane: flechas, Inicio, Fin y doble clic. La cabecera de cada panel lleva sus acciones en una Toolbar (una sola parada de Tab) y un menú (patrón APG «menu button») con mover a la izquierda, derecha, arriba o abajo (intercambia con el vecino de ese lado), dividir y cerrar: es la vía de teclado del arrastre. Arrastrar la cabecera sobre otro panel señala con una zona el borde donde caerá (o el intercambio en el centro) y no cambia nada hasta soltar. Cada movimiento se anuncia en una región `status`; el foco vuelve al menú del panel movido.",
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Editor, vista previa y terminal",
      "code": "<div style={{ height: 360, width: \"100%\" }}>\n  <PaneLayout\n    layout={{\n      type: \"split\",\n      direction: \"row\",\n      sizes: [0.55, 0.45],\n      children: [\n        { type: \"pane\", id: \"editor\" },\n        {\n          type: \"split\",\n          direction: \"column\",\n          sizes: [0.35, 0.65],\n          children: [\n            { type: \"pane\", id: \"preview\" },\n            { type: \"pane\", id: \"terminal\" },\n          ],\n        },\n      ],\n    }}\n    onLayoutChange={setLayout}\n    panes={{\n      editor: { title: \"Editor\", icon: <Icon name=\"code-bracket\" size={14} />, content: <p style={{ padding: 12 }}>Drag a header onto another pane, or use its menu.</p> },\n      preview: { title: \"Preview\", icon: <Icon name=\"eye\" size={14} />, content: <p style={{ padding: 12 }}>Preview</p> },\n      terminal: { title: \"Terminal\", icon: <Icon name=\"command-line\" size={14} />, content: <p style={{ padding: 12 }}>zsh</p> },\n    }}\n  />\n</div>"
    }
  ],
  "html": [
    {
      "title": "Editor, vista previa y terminal",
      "code": "<div style=\"height:360px;width:100%\">\n  <div class=\"z-panelayout\" id=\"pl-demo\" data-divider-label=\"Resize panes\">\n    <div class=\"z-split\" data-direction=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"z-split__pane\" id=\"pl-3-0\" style=\"flex-grow:0.55\">\n        <section class=\"z-panelayout__pane\" data-pane-id=\"editor\" aria-labelledby=\"pl-0-editor-title\">\n          <div class=\"z-pane\" data-focused=\"true\">\n            <div class=\"z-pane__header\">\n              <div class=\"z-panelayout__grab\">\n                <div class=\"z-paneheader\" data-focused=\"true\">\n                  <span class=\"z-paneheader__icon\">\n                    <z-icon name=\"code-bracket\" size=\"14\"></z-icon>\n                  </span>\n                  <div class=\"z-paneheader__titles\">\n                    <span class=\"z-paneheader__title\" id=\"pl-0-editor-title\">Editor</span>\n                  </div>\n                  <div role=\"toolbar\" aria-label=\"Editor pane actions\" aria-orientation=\"horizontal\" class=\"z-toolbar z-paneheader__actions\" data-variant=\"plain\" data-size=\"sm\">\n                    <button type=\"button\" title=\"Editor pane actions\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"pl-editor-menu\" data-z-open=\"#pl-editor-menu\" data-z-placement=\"bottom-end\" id=\"pl-1dcr-trigger\" aria-label=\"Editor pane actions\" class=\"z-btn z-btn--icon z-btn--ghost z-panelayout__menu\" data-size=\"sm\">\n                      <z-icon name=\"ellipsis-horizontal\" size=\"14\"></z-icon>\n                    </button>\n                    <div class=\"z-liquid z-menu\" popover id=\"pl-editor-menu\" role=\"menu\" aria-label=\"Editor pane actions\" data-size=\"md\">\n                      <button type=\"button\" class=\"z-menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-pane-action=\"move-left\" data-pane-for=\"editor\"><span class=\"z-menu__icon\"></span><span class=\"z-menu__text\">Move left</span></button>\n                      <button type=\"button\" class=\"z-menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-pane-action=\"move-right\" data-pane-for=\"editor\"><span class=\"z-menu__icon\"></span><span class=\"z-menu__text\">Move right</span></button>\n                      <button type=\"button\" class=\"z-menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-pane-action=\"move-up\" data-pane-for=\"editor\"><span class=\"z-menu__icon\"></span><span class=\"z-menu__text\">Move up</span></button>\n                      <button type=\"button\" class=\"z-menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-pane-action=\"move-down\" data-pane-for=\"editor\"><span class=\"z-menu__icon\"></span><span class=\"z-menu__text\">Move down</span></button>\n                      <div role=\"separator\" class=\"z-menu__separator\"></div>\n                      <button type=\"button\" class=\"z-menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-danger=\"true\" data-pane-action=\"close\" data-pane-for=\"editor\"><span class=\"z-menu__icon\"><z-icon name=\"x-mark\" size=\"14\"></z-icon></span><span class=\"z-menu__text\">Close pane</span></button>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"z-pane__body\">\n              <p style=\"padding:12px\">Drag a header onto another pane, or use its menu.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n      </div>\n      <div role=\"separator\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-orientation=\"vertical\" aria-label=\"Resize panes\" aria-controls=\"pl-3-0\" aria-valuenow=\"55\" aria-valuemin=\"10\" aria-valuemax=\"90\" class=\"z-split__divider\"></div>\n      <div class=\"z-split__pane\" id=\"pl-3-1\" style=\"flex-grow:0.45\">\n        <div class=\"z-split\" data-direction=\"column\">\n          <div class=\"z-split__pane\" id=\"pl-5b-0\" style=\"flex-grow:0.35\">\n            <section class=\"z-panelayout__pane\" data-pane-id=\"preview\" aria-labelledby=\"pl-0-preview-title\">\n              <div class=\"z-pane\" data-focused=\"false\">\n                <div class=\"z-pane__header\">\n                  <div class=\"z-panelayout__grab\">\n                    <div class=\"z-paneheader\" data-focused=\"false\">\n                      <span class=\"z-paneheader__icon\">\n                        <z-icon name=\"eye\" size=\"14\"></z-icon>\n                      </span>\n                      <div class=\"z-paneheader__titles\">\n                        <span class=\"z-paneheader__title\" id=\"pl-0-preview-title\">Preview</span>\n                      </div>\n                      <div role=\"toolbar\" aria-label=\"Preview pane actions\" aria-orientation=\"horizontal\" class=\"z-toolbar z-paneheader__actions\" data-variant=\"plain\" data-size=\"sm\">\n                        <button type=\"button\" title=\"Preview pane actions\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"pl-preview-menu\" data-z-open=\"#pl-preview-menu\" data-z-placement=\"bottom-end\" id=\"pl-1dctb-trigger\" aria-label=\"Preview pane actions\" class=\"z-btn z-btn--icon z-btn--ghost z-panelayout__menu\" data-size=\"sm\">\n                          <z-icon name=\"ellipsis-horizontal\" size=\"14\"></z-icon>\n                        </button>\n                        <div class=\"z-liquid z-menu\" popover id=\"pl-preview-menu\" role=\"menu\" aria-label=\"Preview pane actions\" data-size=\"md\">\n                          <button type=\"button\" class=\"z-menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-pane-action=\"move-left\" data-pane-for=\"preview\"><span class=\"z-menu__icon\"></span><span class=\"z-menu__text\">Move left</span></button>\n                          <button type=\"button\" class=\"z-menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-pane-action=\"move-right\" data-pane-for=\"preview\"><span class=\"z-menu__icon\"></span><span class=\"z-menu__text\">Move right</span></button>\n                          <button type=\"button\" class=\"z-menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-pane-action=\"move-up\" data-pane-for=\"preview\"><span class=\"z-menu__icon\"></span><span class=\"z-menu__text\">Move up</span></button>\n                          <button type=\"button\" class=\"z-menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-pane-action=\"move-down\" data-pane-for=\"preview\"><span class=\"z-menu__icon\"></span><span class=\"z-menu__text\">Move down</span></button>\n                          <div role=\"separator\" class=\"z-menu__separator\"></div>\n                          <button type=\"button\" class=\"z-menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-danger=\"true\" data-pane-action=\"close\" data-pane-for=\"preview\"><span class=\"z-menu__icon\"><z-icon name=\"x-mark\" size=\"14\"></z-icon></span><span class=\"z-menu__text\">Close pane</span></button>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"z-pane__body\">\n                  <p style=\"padding:12px\">Preview</p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </section>\n          </div>\n          <div role=\"separator\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-orientation=\"horizontal\" aria-label=\"Resize panes\" aria-controls=\"pl-5b-0\" aria-valuenow=\"35\" aria-valuemin=\"10\" aria-valuemax=\"90\" class=\"z-split__divider\"></div>\n          <div class=\"z-split__pane\" id=\"pl-5b-1\" style=\"flex-grow:0.65\">\n            <section class=\"z-panelayout__pane\" data-pane-id=\"terminal\" aria-labelledby=\"pl-0-terminal-title\">\n              <div class=\"z-pane\" data-focused=\"false\">\n                <div class=\"z-pane__header\">\n                  <div class=\"z-panelayout__grab\">\n                    <div class=\"z-paneheader\" data-focused=\"false\">\n                      <span class=\"z-paneheader__icon\">\n                        <z-icon name=\"command-line\" size=\"14\"></z-icon>\n                      </span>\n                      <div class=\"z-paneheader__titles\">\n                        <span class=\"z-paneheader__title\" id=\"pl-0-terminal-title\">Terminal</span>\n                      </div>\n                      <div role=\"toolbar\" aria-label=\"Terminal pane actions\" aria-orientation=\"horizontal\" class=\"z-toolbar z-paneheader__actions\" data-variant=\"plain\" data-size=\"sm\">\n                        <button type=\"button\" title=\"Terminal pane actions\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"pl-terminal-menu\" data-z-open=\"#pl-terminal-menu\" data-z-placement=\"bottom-end\" id=\"pl-1dddb-trigger\" aria-label=\"Terminal pane actions\" class=\"z-btn z-btn--icon z-btn--ghost z-panelayout__menu\" data-size=\"sm\">\n                          <z-icon name=\"ellipsis-horizontal\" size=\"14\"></z-icon>\n                        </button>\n                        <div class=\"z-liquid z-menu\" popover id=\"pl-terminal-menu\" role=\"menu\" aria-label=\"Terminal pane actions\" data-size=\"md\">\n                          <button type=\"button\" class=\"z-menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-pane-action=\"move-left\" data-pane-for=\"terminal\"><span class=\"z-menu__icon\"></span><span class=\"z-menu__text\">Move left</span></button>\n                          <button type=\"button\" class=\"z-menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-pane-action=\"move-right\" data-pane-for=\"terminal\"><span class=\"z-menu__icon\"></span><span class=\"z-menu__text\">Move right</span></button>\n                          <button type=\"button\" class=\"z-menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-pane-action=\"move-up\" data-pane-for=\"terminal\"><span class=\"z-menu__icon\"></span><span class=\"z-menu__text\">Move up</span></button>\n                          <button type=\"button\" class=\"z-menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-pane-action=\"move-down\" data-pane-for=\"terminal\"><span class=\"z-menu__icon\"></span><span class=\"z-menu__text\">Move down</span></button>\n                          <div role=\"separator\" class=\"z-menu__separator\"></div>\n                          <button type=\"button\" class=\"z-menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-danger=\"true\" data-pane-action=\"close\" data-pane-for=\"terminal\"><span class=\"z-menu__icon\"><z-icon name=\"x-mark\" size=\"14\"></z-icon></span><span class=\"z-menu__text\">Close pane</span></button>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"z-pane__body\">\n                  <p style=\"padding:12px\">zsh</p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </section>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"z-panelayout__status z-sr-only\" role=\"status\"></span>\n  </div>\n</div>"
    }
  ],
  "origin": "`PaneTree`, `PaneDropZone`, `PaneDragGhost` y `PaneDropOverlay` de zutool."
}
